{#
  BeMart admin 2段階認証 デバイス登録 — EC-CUBE admin two_factor_auth_set.

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `two_factor_auth_set.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/two_factor_auth_set.twig).

  This is a top-level wave login-context FORM page. It extends the admin
  LOGIN frame (`admin-login-base.html.twig`, the port of EC-CUBE's
  `login_frame.twig`) — EC-CUBE's `two_factor_auth_set.twig` likewise
  `{% extends '@admin/login_frame.twig' %}`. The markup skeleton +
  Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim; only the dynamic bindings are
  rebound to the TwoFactorAuthSet resource body
  (src/Resource/Page/Admin/TwoFactorAuthSet.php).

  FORM-PAGE recipe (Ray.WebFormModule — see var/templates/README.md):
  the resource exposes an
  {@see \MyVendor\BeMart\Form\AdminTwoFactorAuthForm} as `body['form']`.
  The inputs render through that real form object:

    {{ form.input('authKey')|raw }}       <- hidden TOTP secret input
    {{ form.input('deviceToken')|raw }}

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - canonical form action -> `/admin/two-factor-auth-set`.
   - `form_widget(form._token)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. The
     hidden `_token` input is kept (structure) with an empty value;
     EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - the `{% block javascript %}` QR-code block uses `auth_key`,
     `BaseInfo.shop_name` and `Member.name` to build the `otpauth://`
     URI. BeMart's thin-renderer resource has no Be 2FA projection (the
     be/ domain layer is frozen for this wave), so those are exposed as
     `authKey` / `shopName` / `memberName` body placeholders (empty
     until a Be `doSetupTwoFactorAuth` transition lands — flagged as a
     MISSING-BODY-FIELD follow-up in the resource doc). The JS block is
     kept verbatim around them; it is inert without the EC-CUBE bundle,
     same status as the frame's runtime scripts.
   - `{% if error %}` / `form_errors(...)` -> render nothing for the
     pristine form, exactly as EC-CUBE.
#}
{% extends 'admin-login-base.html.twig' %}

{% set title = '2段階認証' %}

{% block javascript %}
<script>
$(function () {
    $("#qrcode").qrcode({
        size: 200,
        fill: '#000',
        text: 'otpauth://totp/{{ ('BeMart:' ~ memberName|default(''))|url_encode }}?secret={{ authKey|default('') }}&issuer={{ 'BeMart'|url_encode }}',
        radius: 0,
        quiet: 0,
        mode: 0, // 0: normal , 1: label strip , 2: label box , 3: image strip , 4: image box
        mSize: 0.1,
        mPosX: 0.5,
        mPosY: 0.5,
        label: 'no label',
        fontname: 'sans',
        fontcolor: '#000',
        image: null
    });
});
</script>
{% endblock %}

{% block main %}
        <style>
        #qrcode canvas { width: 150px; }
        </style>
    <div class="container" style="margin-top: 150px;">
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-12 col-md-6 offset-md-3 col-lg-4 offset-lg-4">
                <div class="text-center p-5 bg-white">
                    <form class="doSetTwoFactorAuth" name="form1" id="form1" method="post" action="/admin/two-factor-auth-set?_method=put">
                        <input type="hidden" id="admin_two_factor_auth__token" name="csrfToken" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token()) }}">
                        {{ form.input('authKey')|raw }}
                        <h5 class="mb-3">2段階認証</h5>
                        <p class="mb-3 text-start">QRコードを2段階認証用スマートフォンアプリで読み込み、表示された6桁の数字を入力してください。</p>
                        <div id="qrcode" class="mb-3"></div>
                        {% if message is defined and message %}
                            <div class="text-danger mb-3 text-start small">{{ message }}</div>
                        {% endif %}
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <div class="mb-3 d-flex justify-content-center">
                                    {{ form.input('deviceToken')|raw }}
                                </div>
                                <p class="mb-3 text-start">{% if form.error('deviceToken') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('deviceToken') }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-12">
                                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary w-100">登録</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-12">
                <p class="text-center mt-3">
                    <small>Copyright &copy; 2026 BeMart. All Rights Reserved.</small>
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

{% endblock %}
